# Run once per minute under the platform supervisor. `resume` is deliberately
# safe to repeat: a live mission lease refuses a duplicate runner, while a
# rebooted machine re-arms supervision, re-runs preflight, and takes over only
# after proving the old runner and any orphaned host process are dead.
#
# Replace both paths and the mission id. Keep the log outside the repository.
* * * * * cd /absolute/path/to/repository && /absolute/path/to/repository/bin/metasystem mission resume --root /absolute/path/to/repository/metasystem --mission example-mission >>/absolute/path/to/mission-runner.log 2>&1
